### loader mode ###
carrybin: start.s + main.c + jump to 0x100000
    output.efi = a thin loader + kernel.bin

carryzip: start.s + main.c + unzip + jump to 0x100000
    output.efi = a decompresser loader + kernel.gz(or xz/bzip...)

loader: work as a complex loader like grub2


### kernel mode ###
msabi: do nothing + jump to efi_main
    compiler = clang(#mingw64 bug: attribute interrupt)
    linker = x86_64-w64-mingw32-gcc
    abi = rcx rdx r8 r9 ...

sysvabi: relocate + jump to efi_main
    compiler = x86_64-elf-gcc
    abi = rdi rsi rdx rcx r8 r9 ...

common: efi_main and other kernel code
